              <items count="2">
                <item name="GUID" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">59e0b89a-e487-49f8-bab8-b5bab16be14c</item>
                <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="8">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A panel for custom notes and text values</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">30d47e13-3e9d-4676-a0d2-72c4b483a400</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Woodie · Complete gallery</item>
                    <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="ScrollRatio" type_name="gh_double" type_code="6">0</item>
                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">WOODIE | 8 PRODUCTS × 11 GEOMETRY CASES

Works in millimetre, metre and inch Rhino documents.
Every preview declares Geometry Units = Millimetres.
Source geometry remains unchanged.

Viewport rows = products; columns = geometry cases.
Flat/bowed solid pairs are visible initially and have
equal centreline lengths. Enable other preview
components or a product group's preview to explore.

Each product uses its own representative thickness.
Open surfaces stay open; presets are visual only.</item>
                  </items>
